          "title": "Latent Semantic Memory distills documents into just 16 memory tokens",
          "summary": "A new method encodes documents into reusable embeddings distilled into 16 memory tokens, beating full-context inference on FactKG (84.33% vs 80.43%) while using roughly 108x fewer tokens, and improving agent performance in TextWorld.",
